{"seq":1,"slug":"english-dutch-sealed-format","title":"英式、荷式与密封拍卖：四种标准机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/english-dutch-sealed-format","wordCount":2215,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"英式-荷式与密封拍卖-四种标准机制\">英式、荷式与密封拍卖：四种标准机制</h1><p>拍卖机制的差异不在「谁出价高谁赢」，而在两个更底层的问题：<strong>价格信息以什么顺序暴露</strong>，以及<strong>赢家按什么价格付款</strong>。这两点决定了竞买人的最优策略，也决定了后端必须持久化哪些状态。本 hub 的其余玩法——代理出价、反狙击、一口价混合、结算与风控——都不是另起炉灶，而是这四种标准机制在工程外壳下的变体：英式（公开升价）、荷式（公开降价）、第一价格密封、第二价格密封（Vickrey）。把基准钉死，后面的每一篇才有可归约的锚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次拍卖可以压缩成三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>rule</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N, v_i, \\text{rule})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rule</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个竞买人各自的私人估值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，以及把出价向量映射到「赢家 + 支付额」的规则。四种标准机制共用同一个分配规则——最高估值者得——区别全部落在支付规则与信息时序上。这是理解后续所有玩法的第一性视角，也是判断「某个玩法改动是否等价于换机制」的依据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[拍卖机制] --&gt; B[公开出价]&#10;  A --&gt; C[密封出价]&#10;  B --&gt; D[英式 升价&lt;br/&gt;价格单调上升]&#10;  B --&gt; E[荷式 降价&lt;br/&gt;价格单调下降]&#10;  C --&gt; F[第一价格&lt;br/&gt;赢家付自己的报价]&#10;  C --&gt; G[第二价格 Vickrey&lt;br/&gt;赢家付次高报价]&#10;  D -. 策略等价 .-&gt; G&#10;  E -. 策略等价 .-&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[拍卖机制] --&gt; B[公开出价]\n  A --&gt; C[密封出价]\n  B --&gt; D[英式 升价&lt;br/&gt;价格单调上升]\n  B --&gt; E[荷式 降价&lt;br/&gt;价格单调下降]\n  C --&gt; F[第一价格&lt;br/&gt;赢家付自己的报价]\n  C --&gt; G[第二价格 Vickrey&lt;br/&gt;赢家付次高报价]\n  D -. 策略等价 .-&gt; G\n  E -. 策略等价 .-&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>价格方向</th>\n<th>信息时序</th>\n<th>赢家支付</th>\n<th>占优/均衡策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>英式</td>\n<td>升价</td>\n<td>公开逐轮</td>\n<td>最后一次报价</td>\n<td>出价直到等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>荷式</td>\n<td>降价</td>\n<td>公开，仅一次</td>\n<td>接受时的价</td>\n<td>在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一价格密封</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>同时一次性</td>\n<td>自己的报价</td>\n<td>报 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二价格密封</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>同时一次性</td>\n<td>次高报价</td>\n<td>如实报 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表格最后一列是整个机制设计的支点：<strong>第二价格密封下说真话是占优策略</strong>，因为如实报价既不会让你赢在亏损价位，也不会让你错过本可盈利的成交。这个性质是代理出价机制能够成立的全部理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"英式拍卖的开放升价过程\">英式拍卖的开放升价过程</h2><p>英式拍卖的公开性意味着每一轮报价都是一次信息披露：竞争者退出时的价位暴露了他估值的下界。对卖家是好事（信息汇入、抬价动力），对竞买人是有代价的（暴露意图、招来报复性抬价）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"叫价轮次与退出\">叫价轮次与退出</h3><p>拍卖师按既定加价幅度递增报价，把不出价者逐个淘汰，最后仍在场者以最后一次报价成交。工程上要维护的最小状态集是：当前最高价、当前领先者、每个竞买人的在场/退出标记。加价幅度不是随手定的常量，它的阶梯形状直接决定单场拍卖的报价轮数与数据写入量，这一设计见 <a href=\"start-reserve-bid-increment\">起拍价、保留价与加价幅度</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保留价如何截断升价过程\">保留价如何截断升价过程</h3><p>若卖家设定保留价，升价过程会在触及保留价之前直接终止，而不是必然成交。UCC §2-328 把这写成了默认规则：拍卖<strong>默认带保留价（with reserve）</strong>，拍卖人可在宣布成交前的任何时刻撤回标的物；只有明确声明「无保留价（without reserve）」时，标的一经开叫便不可撤回（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/ucc/2/2-328\">Cornell LII, UCC §2-328</a>）。这条默认规则是后端状态机必须存在「未达保留价」终态的法律依据，其处置流程见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/unsold-relist-flow\">流拍处理与重新上拍</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"荷式与密封拍卖的策略等价\">荷式与密封拍卖的策略等价</h2><p>荷式拍卖的价格从高价往下降，直到有人接受；整场只出现一个报价，成交即结束。它与第一价格密封表面上毫无共同点——一个公开、一个密封——但对竞买人的决策结构完全一致：你都必须在不观察他人报价的前提下，选定一个「愿意接受的价格」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降价时钟的节奏\">降价时钟的节奏</h3><p>荷式拍卖的成败高度依赖时钟速度。文献明确指出：时钟过快会压低收益，而足够慢的时钟可以拿到高于密封拍卖的收益（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_auction\">Wikipedia, Dutch auction</a>）。工程含义是每秒降价额（tick rate）必须是一个显式配置、可回放复算的参数，绝不能藏在动画里——否则审计无法从事件流重建成交价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"密封出价的均衡折扣\">密封出价的均衡折扣</h3><p>第一价格密封下如实报价的期望剩余为零，理性竞买人必然折价。在估值独立同分布于均匀分布的基准模型里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个对手时的对称均衡报价为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b(v)=\\frac{N-1}{N}\\,v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（两人竞价）时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b(v)=v/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>——这正是 Vickrey 1961 年给出的经典结果（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vickrey_auction\">Wikipedia, Vickrey auction</a>）。这个形状的折扣是卖家做估价模型的起点：竞争人数越多，折价越小，成交价越接近真实估值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;dutch&quot;,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;start_price&quot;: 1000,&#10;  &quot;reserve_price&quot;: 600,&#10;  &quot;tick&quot;: { &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;linear&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: 20, &quot;interval_ms&quot;: 3000 },&#10;  &quot;accept&quot;: { &quot;first_accept_wins&quot;: true, &quot;auto_close&quot;: true },&#10;  &quot;states&quot;: [&quot;scheduled&quot;, &quot;running&quot;, &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;unsold&quot;, &quot;cancelled&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dutch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"start_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reserve_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tick\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"linear\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"interval_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"first_accept_wins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"auto_close\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"states\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scheduled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"running\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accepted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unsold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cancelled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"等价性何时失效\">等价性何时失效</h3><p>等价成立需要三个前提：风险中性、私人估值、单次决策机会。荷式拍卖里所有人都实时观察「是否已有人接受」这个公共信号，而密封拍卖没有；当竞买人厌恶风险或标的存在共同价值成分时，两条路径的收益会出现可观测的分离。工程上这意味着不能假设「改成荷式＝收益不变」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收入等价定理与中标者诅咒\">收入等价定理与中标者诅咒</h2><h3 id=\"基准模型与结论\">基准模型与结论</h3><p>在风险中性、估值独立私有、支付只依赖出价的基准模型下，任何标准配置机制给卖家带来的期望收入相同，给同一类型竞买人带来的期望剩余也相同——这就是收入等价定理。Vickrey 证明了两人均匀分布的情形，Riley、Samuelson（1981）与 Myerson（1981）各自把它推广到一般情形（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auction_theory\">Wikipedia, Auction theory</a>）。</p>\n<p>对平台工程的反直觉含义是：<strong>不要指望靠换机制名称来系统性提高收入</strong>。真正改变收入的是保留价、参与人数与信息结构（谁能看到什么、何时看到），而不是「英式」还是「荷式」这个标签。</p>\n<h3 id=\"共同价值下的中标者诅咒\">共同价值下的中标者诅咒</h3><p>当标的存在一个共同的、所有人都在猜测的真实价值（成色未知的批量尾货、真伪待鉴的收藏品），赢家往往是出价最乐观的那一个：中标的瞬间就意味着「别人估得比我低」。理性竞买人会预期这一偏差并压低报价，但行为上该现象依然普遍（同上）。在收藏品与二手奢侈品场景里，这是「流拍率异常偏高」的常见成因，也是风控需要区分「恶意流拍」与「中标者诅咒」的原因，见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/unsold-relist-flow\">流拍处理与重新上拍</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在线平台上四类机制的映射\">在线平台上四类机制的映射</h2><p>在线平台几乎从不原样实现教科书机制，而是先做等价变换，再套上工程外壳。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代理出价把英式折叠成第二价格\">代理出价把英式折叠成第二价格</h3><p>代理出价让竞买人一次性录入最高愿付价，系统只代表他抬到「刚好超过次高价」的水平。Wikipedia 对它的定义很精确：这是「一个迭代式的密封出价拍卖，赢家按超过次高价的固定增量付款」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auction_sniping\">Wikipedia, Auction sniping</a>）。它把连续叫价的英式拍卖折叠成「一次录入 + 事件流重放」，从而把实时广播问题转化成了并发一致性问题，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"机制选择的工程权衡\">机制选择的工程权衡</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要工程代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>英式 + 代理出价</td>\n<td>通用商品，需最大化参与</td>\n<td>高并发出价，出价序列必须可重放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>荷式降价</td>\n<td>时效性强、批量清货</td>\n<td>时钟状态机，接受事件必须全局唯一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密封（一价/二价）</td>\n<td>高价值、需防串通</td>\n<td>出价保密，结果不可中途回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一口价混合</td>\n<td>卖家急于成交</td>\n<td>买入与出价并发，需严格串行化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四种标准机制只在<strong>支付规则</strong>与<strong>信息时序</strong>上分叉，分配规则统一为最高估值者得。</li>\n<li>第二价格密封的占优策略是如实报价；第一价格密封的对称均衡是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b(v)=\\frac{N-1}{N}v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，折价随竞争人数递减。</li>\n<li>英式与第二价格密封、荷式与第一价格密封分别策略等价，前提是风险中性、私人估值与单次决策。</li>\n<li>收入等价定理说明机制名称不改收入，保留价与参与人数才改；共同价值标的必须防范中标者诅咒。</li>\n<li>UCC §2-328 的「默认带保留价」为「未达保留价」终态提供了法律依据。</li>\n<li>在线平台用代理出价把英式折叠成可重放的密封形式，用一口价把拍卖与固定价并置——两者的工程细节分别在第二篇与第三篇展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"英式、荷式与密封拍卖：四种标准机制","id":"英式-荷式与密封拍卖-四种标准机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"英式拍卖的开放升价过程","id":"英式拍卖的开放升价过程"},{"level":3,"text":"叫价轮次与退出","id":"叫价轮次与退出"},{"level":3,"text":"保留价如何截断升价过程","id":"保留价如何截断升价过程"},{"level":2,"text":"荷式与密封拍卖的策略等价","id":"荷式与密封拍卖的策略等价"},{"level":3,"text":"降价时钟的节奏","id":"降价时钟的节奏"},{"level":3,"text":"密封出价的均衡折扣","id":"密封出价的均衡折扣"},{"level":3,"text":"等价性何时失效","id":"等价性何时失效"},{"level":2,"text":"收入等价定理与中标者诅咒","id":"收入等价定理与中标者诅咒"},{"level":3,"text":"基准模型与结论","id":"基准模型与结论"},{"level":3,"text":"共同价值下的中标者诅咒","id":"共同价值下的中标者诅咒"},{"level":2,"text":"在线平台上四类机制的映射","id":"在线平台上四类机制的映射"},{"level":3,"text":"代理出价把英式折叠成第二价格","id":"代理出价把英式折叠成第二价格"},{"level":3,"text":"机制选择的工程权衡","id":"机制选择的工程权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"一口价与拍卖混合：买断期权与并发串行化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/buy-now-hybrid-auction"}}